"""
NyxForge Tax Report mockup generator.
Generates docs/storyboards/out/tax-report-mockup.html

Tax reporting UI for NGOs using the NyxForge platform:
  - Fiat donation summaries for IRS Form 990 / Schedule B
  - XMR acquisition and disposition ledger (Form 8949 / Schedule D)
  - Donor acknowledgment letter generation (501(c)(3) receipts)
  - Export to CSV, PDF, TurboTax, accountant packages

5 frames:
  1. Overview        -- year selector, event summary, export shortcuts
  2. Donation Summary-- fiat donations by processor/donor, 990 Schedule B data
  3. Crypto Ledger   -- XMR cost basis, acquisitions, dispositions, gain/loss
  4. Generate Report -- report type, date range, format, preview
  5. Donor Receipts  -- 501(c)(3) acknowledgment letters per donor
"""
